img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164900162,"discussion_id":"cc034e624b5d82678328966acb303b9865a8001e","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-11T11:21:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T11:21:15+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164900197,"discussion_id":"3523b858ae4cb0f1cfc6eb6ab85fa65afc9bf299","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-11T11:21:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T11:21:24+08:00","user":{"id":"6886dea5bac92f260ce3b98d","login":"liangtongxue","object_id":"6886dea5bac92f260ce3b98d","name":"liangtongxue","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liangtongxue"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164900232,"discussion_id":"1880e778737e3fdd1b0f990c74b5983ce9bfd95d","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复DropOut算子向量化实现中因浮点数运算顺序导致的潜在精度问题。原实现中，输出计算顺序为`input * scale * mask`，当掩码为0时，由于浮点数舍入误差，可能产生微小的非零输出，影响计算结果的确定性。本次修改旨在确保掩码为0时输出严格为0，提升数值稳定性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了向量化DropOut内核函数`SimtDropOutVec`的核心计算表达式。将输出计算从`input * scale * mask`调整为`input * mask * scale`。这一顺序调整确保了当掩码位为0时，乘法运算的中间结果和最终输出均为0，从根本上消除了因浮点数运算顺序可能引入的非零值，保证了DropOut操作在掩码失效时的正确性。修改属于逻辑优化，不涉及新增功能或接口。","created_at":"2026-03-11T11:21:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T11:21:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_